+---
+id: def-qftx-n2-coulomb-branch-data
+kind: definition
+title: Pure N=2 SU(2) Coulomb-branch and period data
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
