+---
+id: def-qftx-n2-monopole-local-dual-higgs-model
+kind: definition
+title: Local dual U(1) monopole-Higgs effective data
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 6
