+---
+id: def-qftx-susy-vacuum-moduli-data
+kind: definition
+title: Classical and quantum supersymmetric vacuum-moduli data
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 0
