@@ -0,0 +1,100 @@
+---
+id: ex-qftx-n2-monopole-perturbed-vacuum
+kind: example
+title: Symbolic monopole vacuum in the local dual U(1) model
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 7
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
