+---
+id: pthm-qftx-n2-dual-higgs-vortex-flux-and-tension
+kind: physics-theorem
+title: Flux quantization and positive tension for an admitted dual vortex
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 10
