+---
+id: def-qftx-n2-dual-higgs-flux-tube-sector
+kind: definition
+title: Finite-energy dual-Higgs flux-tube sector
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 9
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
