+---
+id: ex-qftx-n1-sqcd-su-nf-cubic-anomaly-check
+kind: example
+title: SU(Nf) cubic-anomaly check for proposed SQCD dual data
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 0
+domain: physics
