+---
+id: ex-qftx-susy-u1-pair-classical-vacuum-moduli
+kind: example
+title: One-flavor U(1) classical F/D-flat vacuum quotient
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 1
+domain: physics
